+# Notification Platform — Day 1 Foundation Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Scaffold a production-grade NestJS monorepo with all infrastructure services, shared libraries, CI/CD, code quality tools, and comprehensive documentation.
+
+**Architecture:** NestJS monorepo mode with apps under `apps/` and shared libraries under `libs/`. pnpm for package management. Docker Compose for local infrastructure (PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ, LocalStack, Prometheus, Grafana, Jaeger, Mailhog, Adminer). OpenTelemetry for distributed tracing. Pino for structured logging. Terminus for health checks. Prisma for database ORM (connection only, no tables yet).
+
+**Tech Stack:** Node.js 24, NestJS, TypeScript (strict), pnpm, PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ, Prisma, Zod, Pino, OpenTelemetry, Prometheus, Grafana, Jaeger, Terminus, Docker Compose, Husky, ESLint, Prettier, GitHub Actions.
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- All code in TypeScript with `strict: true`
+- No `any` — ESLint rule `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any: error`
+- No business logic for notifications — Day 1 is infrastructure only
+- Every app has: `src/`, `test/`, `Dockerfile`, `package.json`, NestJS bootstrap, AppModule, HealthController, HealthService
+- Every lib has: `src/` with `index.ts`, `<name>.module.ts`, `package.json`, `tsconfig.lib.json`
+- All file paths relative to `notification-system/` root unless absolute
+- Conventional commits for all git messages
+
+---
