+# Notification Platform
+
+A production-grade notification platform built with NestJS, designed to serve millions of notifications across email, push, SMS, and WebSocket channels.
+
+> **Status:** Day 1 — Foundation scaffolding complete. Core services under active development.
+
+## Architecture
+
+```
+┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐     ┌────────────────┐
+│  API Gateway │────▶│ Notification Svc │────▶│  Email Service  │
+│  (NestJS)    │     │  (Orchestrator)  │     │  (NestJS)       │
+└─────────────┘     └──────────────────┘     └────────────────┘
+                          │                           │
+                          ▼                           ▼
+                    ┌──────────┐              ┌──────────┐
+                    │ RabbitMQ │              │   AWS    │
+                    │   Event  │              │  SNS/SQS │
+                    │   Bus    │              │          │
+                    └──────────┘              └──────────┘
+                          │
+                          ▼
+                    ┌──────────┐
+                    │  Worker  │
+                    │  Service │
+                    │  (Retry) │
+                    └──────────┘
+```
+
+## Tech Stack
+
+| Category          | Technology                          |
+|-------------------|-------------------------------------|
+| Framework         | NestJS                              |
+| Language          | TypeScript (strict)                 |
+| Database          | PostgreSQL via Prisma ORM           |
+| Cache             | Redis                               |
+| Message Broker    | RabbitMQ                            |
+| Cloud Emulation   | LocalStack (SNS/SQS)                |
+| Logging           | Pino                                |
+| Tracing           | OpenTelemetry + Jaeger              |
+| Metrics           | Prometheus + Grafana                |
+| Validation        | Zod                                 |
+| Containerization  | Docker + Docker Compose             |
+
