+`docs/adr/ADR-002-prisma.md`:
+```markdown
+# ADR-002: Why Prisma
+
+## Status
+Accepted
+
+## Context
+We need an ORM for PostgreSQL that provides type safety, migration management, and excellent developer experience.
+
+## Decision
+Use Prisma ORM.
+
+## Rationale
+- **Type safety**: Generated types match the database schema exactly
+- **Migration management**: Declarative schema → auto-generated migrations
+- **Studio**: Built-in GUI for data exploration during development
+- **Performance**: Efficient query generation with relation loading strategies
+- **Ecosystem**: Well-maintained with active community
+- **Migrations**: Safe, reversible migration workflow
+
+## Consequences
+- Additional build step (prisma generate)
+- Complex queries may require raw SQL
+- Migration conflicts need manual resolution in team settings
+```
