+# ADR-004: Why OpenTelemetry
+
+## Status
+Accepted
+
+## Context
+We need distributed tracing across multiple microservices to debug and monitor notification delivery flows.
+
+## Decision
+Use OpenTelemetry for distributed tracing.
+
+## Rationale
+- **Standard**: CNCF incubating project, industry standard for observability
+- **Auto-instrumentation**: Automatic tracing of HTTP, gRPC, database calls
+- **Vendor-neutral**: Export to Jaeger, Zipkin, Datadog, or any OTLP backend
+- **Context propagation**: Trace context propagates through RabbitMQ headers
+- **NestJS integration**: First-class support via @opentelemetry/instrumentation-express
+
+## Consequences
+- Performance overhead from instrumentation (minimal)
+- Complex configuration for advanced sampling strategies
+- Requires OTLP-compatible backend (Jaeger in development)
+```
